Here are a few more interesting ways to die that haven't been mentioned yet
(taken from the local logfile):

killed by a yellow dragon called Dick
	[All right guys, quit goofing around with the 'C' command!]

went to heaven prematurely
	[Try level teleporting to levels -10 to -128! Yes it can be done!]

teleported out of the dengeon and fell to his death
	[Level teleport to levels -1 to -9 (without a levitation ring on).]

quit while already on Charon's boat
	[Not technically a 'death' but thought I'd mention it anyway.]

player, killed by a hallucinogen-distorted ghost of player
	[The person was hallucinating when killed by their own ghost!]


Now, how about those heartbreaker games? Like drowning in the moat in
the endgame, or choking on a wraith corpse when on your way up with
the amulet, or having to quit on the endgame because you dropped the
amulet and you were being levitated by a cursed item and your god was
pissed off at you and you didn't have anything to remove it with, etc.

